 "paddingBottom": 20,
 "minWidth": 1,
 "propagateClick": false,
 "bottom": "4.43%",
 "class": "HTMLText",
 "borderSize": 0,
 "paddingRight": 20,
 "scrollBarOpacity": 0.5,
 "scrollBarColor": "#000000",
 "scrollBarVisible": "rollOver",
 "shadow": false,
 "scrollBarMargin": 2,
 "height": "85.624%",
 "paddingLeft": 20,
 "html": "<div style=\"text-align:left; color:#000; \"><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-size:20px;font-family:'Montserrat';\"><B>KAVA RESTO</B></SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">Kava Resto adalah restoran yang terletak di Fairfield by Marriott Surabaya. Restoran ini menyediakan berbagai hidangan lokal Indonesia dan internasional, dengan konsep all-day dining. Kava Resto terkenal dengan suasana modern dan nyaman, serta pilihan menu yang bervariasi, termasuk sarapan prasmanan yang populer di kalangan tamu hotel.</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">Restoran ini juga sering digunakan untuk acara keluarga atau pertemuan bisnis karena kapasitasnya yang cukup besar dan lokasinya yang strategis. Fasilitasnya dekat dengan kolam renang, menambah suasana santai bagi para tamu. Kava Restaurant menawarkan berbagai fitur, seperti:</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Reservasi</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Tempat duduk di area terbuka</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Makan malam pribadi</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Akses kursi roda</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Wi-Fi gratis</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Menerima kartu kredit</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:justify;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Montserrat';\">* Pelayanan di meja</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p></div>",
